docs {
  # POST /api/sales/ — Create sale (full)

  Same as `post_create_minimal.bru` but includes optional `client_last_name`. Requires `Authorization: Token {{token}}`. Source: `SaleSerializer:56` (`client_last_name` `required=False, allow_blank, allow_null`).

  No `vip_code` here either → `vip_code:null`.

  ## Status codes

  - `201 Created` — success
  - `400 Bad Request` — invalid FKs
  - `401 Unauthorized` — invalid `vip_code` or token

  ## Response (201)

  ```json
  {
    "status": "success",
    "message": "Sale created successfully",
    "data": {
      "payment_link": "https://checkout.stripe.com/c/pay/..."
    }
  }
  ```

  ## Notes

  - `client_last_name` `""` or `null` also allowed (same optional handling as `vip_code`).
  - See `post_create_with_valid_vip_code.bru` for vip variant.
}
